@format 1
@id split.section-delete
@title Delete section
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Confirm and remove the active section, select the nearest survivor, and synchronize section state.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag delete

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Delete section command <input>
- Receive the delete command for the active section @ flow.PFlowSectionDelete(...)
> guard

[guard] Confirm deletion <decision>
- Confirm that a section is selected @ flow.PFlowSectionDelete(...)
- Request destructive-action confirmation when configured @ flow.PFlowDestructiveConfirm(...)
? "Deletion is confirmed" > remove
? "No selection or confirmation declined" > unchanged

[remove] Remove section <process>
- Record the section deletion @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
- Remove the active section and select the nearest remaining section @ flow.PFlowSectionDelete(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
= The section list is unchanged.
